- Whoever approves needs a PIN (staff menu → **Set my PIN**) and a role with **Approve with PIN** that allows the action itself.
- Wrong PINs are limited: after several tries the POS waits before accepting more.
- Every approval is recorded in the **Audit Log** with who asked and who approved."}},{"node":"markdown103","element":"markdown","data":{"label":"Voids","key":"md_voids","id":"voids","name":"md_voids","value":"# Voids

Voiding lines or orders already sent to the kitchen needs a **reason** (Ren Void Reasons: Guest changed mind, Kitchen error, Wrong item… Reasons marked *Requires a note* ask for an explanation). The kitchen sees it on its screen and gets a VOID ticket if it prints. Every void is in the **Void Log**: what, how much, who, why, and who approved it.

Lines not sent yet are simply deleted; they never reached the kitchen."}},{"node":"markdown104","element":"markdown","data":{"label":"Sold out (86)","key":"md_sold_out_86","id":"sold-out-86","name":"md_sold_out_86","value":"# Sold out (86)

The **86** button on the order screen marks an item as sold out on every screen and on online ordering until it is **Available again**. A single option can be made unavailable from the item editor. Needs *Mark items sold out (86)*."}},{"node":"markdown105","element":"markdown","data":{"label":"Other manager tools","key":"md_other_manager_tools","id":"other-manager-tools","name":"md_other_manager_tools","value":"# Other manager tools

- **Staff**: add people, roles and access ([Staff and roles](/Docs/Staff%20and%20Roles)). Changes reach open screens immediately.
- **Register this terminal** in the staff menu, for PIN login on shared devices.
- **Edit the floor plan** and the **Menu Manager** from the pencil on the POS.
- Reports in ERPNext: sales by item, POS Invoices, register closings, and the **Ingredient Usage Variance** report."}}]}]
